00:15:43.480 --> 00:15:53.930
Francesco D'Amato: Yeah, so the first thing I was saying, about the loss of safety when you exit a bunch of these, non-PQ validators, that's, yeah, that's basically…

112
00:15:54.990 --> 00:15:58.529
