01:45:07.130 --> 01:45:10.970
Justin Traglia: Because they just had more time to produce aggregates with all the attestations.

862
01:45:14.370 --> 01:45:18.540
Justin Traglia: Like, there shouldn't be a case where… Well, I don't know.

863
01:45:18.540 --> 01:45:20.719
Kevaundray Wedderburn: Oh, I see. Hmm. Right.

864
01:45:21.950 --> 01:45:27.739
Justin Traglia: I mean, that doesn't… that's not true if there's, like, a really late attestation or something, or… maybe it is.

